 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAtelier Provence SAS                                      MASTER SERVICES\n12 Rue de la République, 13001 Marseille, France          AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR22 996553598\nReg No: FR-120470\n\nFROM                                                     FACTURÉ À\n\nAtelier Provence SAS                                     Atelier Provence SAS\n12 Rue de la République                                  45 Avenue Victor Hugo\n13001 Marseille                                          75008 Paris\nFrance                                                   France\nVAT: FR22 996553598\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 21/04/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Atelier Provence SAS, with its registered office at 12 Rue de la République, Marseille (\"Party A\"), and Atelier\nProvence SAS, with its registered office at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo, Paris (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Atelier Provence SAS / Sophie Bernard\nParty B    Atelier Provence SAS / Sophie Bernard\nDate       21/04/2026",
